---
title: "Update organization SSO policy"
icon: pencil
description: "Update organization SSO policy: updateOrganizationSsoPolicy in the TypeScript, Python and Rust clients."
---

`PATCH /v1/auth/organizations/{orgId}/sso`

Updates whether SSO can admit new members automatically using ssoJitEnabled and the current expectedVersion. Returns the organization’s SSO configuration and policy synchronization status; a successful response does not mean every desired policy setting has finished synchronizing.

<Tabs>
<Tab title="TypeScript">
```typescript TypeScript
photon.auth.updateOrganizationSsoPolicy(input: UpdateOrganizationSsoPolicyInput, options?: RequestOptions): Promise<UpdateOrganizationSsoPolicyOutput>
```
</Tab>
